---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About SaveFileTool | RPG Maker Save Editor"
  description="SaveFileTool is a browser-based RPG Maker save editor for compatible local save files, with backup-first guidance and clear support limits."
>
  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12">
    <div class="mb-16 text-center">
      <h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white md:text-5xl">
        About SaveFileTool
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        SaveFileTool is a focused browser-based editor for compatible RPG Maker save files.
        The public editor is intentionally scoped, backup-first, and clear about its limits.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-16 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-sm dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800">
        <div class="mb-2 text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600">Browser</div>
        <div class="font-medium text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Main Editing Flow</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-sm dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800">
        <div class="mb-2 text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600">6</div>
        <div class="font-medium text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">RPG Maker Extensions</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-sm dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800">
        <div class="mb-2 text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600">Free</div>
        <div class="font-medium text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">No Account Required</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-blue max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2>Our Scope</h2>
        <p>
          The published editor is for RPG Maker MV/MZ <code>.rpgsave</code> and
          <code>.rmmzsave</code> files, plus limited common-field editing for older RPG Maker
          <code>.rvdata2</code>, <code>.rvdata</code>, <code>.rxdata</code>, and
          <code>.lsd</code> saves.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not present the current public site as a universal save editor. If a format is not
          listed on the RPG Maker editor page, it is outside the public support scope for this build.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-16 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 p-8 dark:bg-gray-800 md:p-12">
        <h2>Privacy Model</h2>
        <p>
          The main editor reads and rebuilds selected files in the browser. The old recovery page
          and server parse API have been removed so the product message stays aligned with the
          local-processing workflow.
        </p>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics and AdSense for site performance and ads; see the Privacy and
          Cookie policies for details.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-16">
        <h2>Published Support</h2>
        <div class="not-prose grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-4 dark:border-gray-700">
            <div class="font-bold">RPG Maker MV/MZ</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">.rpgsave, .rmmzsave</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-4 dark:border-gray-700">
            <div class="font-bold">RPG Maker XP/VX/VX Ace</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">.rvdata2, .rvdata, .rxdata</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-4 dark:border-gray-700">
            <div class="font-bold">RPG Maker 2000/2003</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">.lsd</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
